&lt;p&gt;📄 &lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/181835/rss" style=" color: #3366aa; font-weight: 500 !important;   "&gt;How to Decode a VIN in JavaScript&lt;/a&gt; – VINs (&lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/181836/rss" style=" color: #3366aa; font-weight: 500 !important;   "&gt;Vehicle Identification Numbers&lt;/a&gt;) are standardized codes assigned to various types of motor vehicle. &lt;cite&gt;Cardog&lt;/cite&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
